{"id":"reference/opaque","kind":"langref","title":"opaque","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#opaque","file":"reference/opaque.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"opaque","text":"opaque"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"opaque\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/opaque/#opaque\">opaque</a></h2>\n\n      <p><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">opaque</span> {}</code> 声明一个大小和对齐均未知但非零的新类型。它可以像<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/struct/#struct\">结构体</a>、<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/union/#union\">联合</a>和<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/enum/#enum\">枚举</a>一样包含声明。</p>\n      <p>这通常用于与不公开结构体细节的 C 代码交互时保证类型安全。例如：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_opaque.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Derp = <span class=\"tok-kw\">opaque</span> {};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Wat = <span class=\"tok-kw\">opaque</span> {};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">extern</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">bar</span>(d: *Derp) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">foo</span>(w: *Wat) <span class=\"tok-kw\">callconv</span>(.c) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    bar(w);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"call foo\"</span> {\n    foo(<span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span>);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_opaque.zig</kbd>\n<span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_opaque.zig:6:9: </span><span class=\"sgr-31m\">error: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">expected type '*test_opaque.Derp', found '*test_opaque.Wat'\n</span>    bar(w);\n        <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_opaque.zig:6:9: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">pointer type child 'test_opaque.Wat' cannot cast into pointer type child 'test_opaque.Derp'\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_opaque.zig:2:13: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">opaque declared here\n</span>const Wat = opaque {};\n            <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^~~~~~~~~\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_opaque.zig:1:14: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">opaque declared here\n</span>const Derp = opaque {};\n             <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^~~~~~~~~\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_opaque.zig:4:18: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">parameter type declared here\n</span>extern fn bar(d: *Derp) void;\n                 <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^~~~~\n</span><span class=\"sgr-2m\">referenced by:\n    test.call foo: /home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_opaque.zig:10:8\n</span>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n\n      ","translation":{"total":4,"translated":4}}
